#. translators: %s: the wp-config.php constant name
#: app/Services/Checks/Config/SecretEncryptionCheck.php:98
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The %s value in your wp-config.php is not the one these secrets were "
"encrypted with. If you still have the previous value, you can paste it in on"
" the two-factor settings screen and everything will be re-encrypted under "
"the new one."
msgstr ""
"Der Wert %s in Deiner wp-config.php ist nicht der, mit dem diese "
"Geheimschlüssel verschlüsselt wurden. Wenn Du den bisherigen Wert noch hast,"
