"Signed out %1$s sessions and permanently deleted %2$s application passwords."
msgstr ""
"%1$s Sitzungen abgemeldet und %2$s Anwendungspasswörter endgültig gelöscht."

#: app/Services/Recovery/RecoveryService.php:161
msgid ""
"The eight security keys have been replaced, so you have been signed out here"
